{"identity_key": "bilibili:1261829690476199940", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1261829690476199940", "content": "休闲类SLG+ADV《咪卡\"药\"幸福》中文版Steam商店页面正式上线！\n✨ 立即加入愿望单！不错过最新消息与首发折扣！✨\n👉Steam商店：：https://store.steampowered.com/app/4463780?utm_source=bili&utm_campaign=StoreOpen\n\n📖 故事简介\n这是一款旅行的少女咪卡透过「幸福药水」，把人类世界搞得天翻地覆的经营模拟风冒险游戏。\n\n用「幸福药水」让人类获得幸福吧！\n制作并贩售「幸福药水」，人们就会变得幸福。\n随着人们越来越幸福，城镇中也会发生各式各样的事件。\n让药水不断在各地流通，让人类彻底沉浸在幸福之中吧！\n来到索多米亚王国的咪卡，和几位人类女孩成为了好朋友。\n\n透过她们，能够真切感受到人类逐渐变得幸福的样子。\n\n📌作品信息\n・社团 / 作者：GFF", "publisher": "Shiravune白舟_官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1261829690476199940", "published_at": "2026-10-22T01:03:39+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T15:28:00.435009+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/5567d639c5834963341f89db29c279543493105997187935.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/a75ec9acff32cf6510d2bb492388169a3493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/202b2ff1ac201b4ecab4be9337af155b3493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/5cbf2d8a82c2f47899e28306416318c83493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/cbb66e45cfe73fb750021416830bee8e3493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f2da83e908ee00246767a886037f58313493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/5b9fb3959e30297342889eea34b90f353493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/230a5505e3510d0e3fda595247fb6fec3493105997187935.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/2032549d79437c69fd14548cf9ee00e13493105997187935.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3493105997187935", "uid": "3493105997187935", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 123, "retweets": 1, 